 " is determined by its distances to the vertices of ",
 StyleBox["basis", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"64fddacd-9491-40b7-b13b-13cd509b8b62"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Definition: a list ",
 StyleBox["B", "TI"],
 " = (",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 "\:2081, \[Ellipsis], ",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 "\:2096) of vertices resolves ",
 StyleBox["g", "TI"],
 " when the radar map ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " \[RightTeeArrow] (",
 StyleBox["d", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 "\:2081), \[Ellipsis], ",
 StyleBox["d", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 "\:2096)) is injective on the vertices of ",
 StyleBox["g", "TI"],
 ": for every two vertices ",
 StyleBox["u", "TI"],
 " \[NotEqual] ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " some ",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 " in ",
 StyleBox["B", "TI"],
 " has ",
 StyleBox["d", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["u", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 ") \[NotEqual] ",
 StyleBox["d", "TI"],
 "(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["b", "TI"],
 "). The map is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["RadarCoordinates"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/RadarCoordinates", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "54be7558-6482-4f6b-90f3-f18e904da520"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ceb8a649-09ad-43f2-b829-7c5e5bbd92ce"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A list that contains a resolving set resolves, and so does every list of \
all the vertices but one. A smallest resolving set is a metric basis, found \
by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FindResolvingSet"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/FindResolvingSet", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "e67c536a-517c-4bdd-b447-dda6a5e5dda7"],
 "; its size is the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["MetricDimension"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/MetricDimension", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "d6d11005-e835-4e49-90c3-a526bb0da68b"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"623cd412-33b2-4759-bc75-20d221a93c0b"]
}, Open  ]],

