Cell["\<\
A list resolves exactly when the radar coordinates from it are distinct. Two \
corners of the hexagonal tiling give 109 vertices 67 coordinates, three \
corners give them 109.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"25d226e5-62aa-43c3-b728-bfa4e2a65ab0"],

